    "created_at": "2016-09-14T11:59:57Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-09-14T11:59:57Z",
    "body": "Does this amount to whether loading a data: URL in a media element then allows you to access any in-band text tracks and painting video frames to a canvas? I take it that right now some implementations (Chrome?) treat it as cross-origin and some (Gecko?) as same-origin?\n",
